   "why": "The same sender's record, already held, is not stored again: a resent push (a retry or a replay) is acknowledged as before, but appends nothing to received-capsules.jsonl or received-provenance.jsonl. The Python door appends both lines on every resend, so a peer resending one genuine record could grow the held stores without bound. A bundle's proof is still judged and held on its own terms."
  },
