   "why": "The Python door compares the bundle marker with `!= 1`, and in Python `True == 1`, so a bundle marked `\"record_push_bundle\": true` is read as version 1. Every other count in a bundle must be an exact integer, never a bool (the door's own S2 rule); the port applies that rule to the marker too and refuses the bundle bundle_malformed."
  },
